!Repository: <a href="https://github.com/Dash-Industry-Forum/IOPv5">Dash-Industry-Forum/IOPv5</a>
!Issue Tracking: File issues at <a href="https://github.com/Dash-Industry-Forum/IOPv5/issues">IOPv5 GitHub</a> with prefix <code>[Part 1]:</code> and assign to the <a href="https://github.com/orgs/Dash-Industry-Forum/projects">Part 1 GitHub Project</a>. See <a href="#issue-reporting">§1.3</a>.
